#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your Quantum-safe cryptography badge, take the exam at IBM&reg; "
"Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in "
"this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that "
"you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para obtener tu insignia de criptografía cuántica segura, realiza el examen "
"en IBM&reg; Training. Este examen está diseñado para realizarse después de "
"leer las lecciones de este curso. Después de aprobar el examen, Credly te "
"notificará que has recibido una insignia.\n"

